<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαρής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without weight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				277b19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαρῆ εἶναι ἀέρα καὶ πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zeno Stoic.
					1.27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.143
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.9.9
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>light,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.461
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χρῆμα</span> a
				<i>light</i> matter, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				158
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρρησία . . μαλακὴ καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.59c
				</span></i>
			; of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.651
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not offensive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσμαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i>not burdensome,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἑαυτὸν τηρεῖν, παρέχειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				11.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				5361.15
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Berenice</span>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>”
				<i>without giving offence,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Epict.</u>
					p.85D.
				</span></i>
			; <i>without taking offence,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				p.88D.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
